        "Description": "Weeks after the Hokkaido incident, stolen banking records exposed the final branch of the network operating inside Milton-Fitzpatrick Bank in New York. Travers Nye, a corrupt financial strategist from India, helped with the laundering of millions for Ivan Berezovski. Matt Platt, an internal security chief who erased digital evidence for the organization, and Ezequiel Grogan, an Bulgarian visitor who is looking out for threats against Matt Platt. Find them and eliminate them.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
